# STARDUST: a touch game. The finger is put on the nearest star each time and
# the comet follows it; 20 stars are caught by frame 445.
# Run (from boards/desktop): pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 30 --frames 460 --script stardust.script --shot <frames> --out <folder>

# --- home screen (boot off): step right 12 tiles to STARDUST, then start it
46 press right
47 release right
48 press right
49 release right
50 press right
51 release right
52 press right
53 release right
54 press right
55 release right
56 press right
57 release right
58 press right
59 release right
60 press right
61 release right
62 press right
63 release right
64 press right
65 release right
66 press right
67 release right
68 press right
69 release right
70 press south   # start STARDUST
71 release south

